%% ==== sequence_upload
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant B as Browser (React)
  participant A as API (Express)
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  participant Q as Redis queue
  participant W as AI worker
  U->>B: choose video, title, mode
  B->>A: POST /api/matches (multipart)
  A->>A: validate type, size, magic number
  A->>D: INSERT match (QUEUED)
  A->>Q: add job {matchId, videoPath, mode}
  A-->>B: 201 Created {match}
  B->>A: WebSocket connect (login cookie)
  Q->>W: job becomes active
  Q-->>A: event "active"
  A->>D: status = PROCESSING
  A-->>B: match:updated
  loop every stage of the pipeline
    W->>Q: updateProgress {percent, stage}
    Q-->>A: event "progress"
    A->>D: progress, stage
    A-->>B: match:updated (progress bar moves)
  end
  W->>W: write results JSON + H.264 copy
  W->>Q: return {resultPath, playbackPath, summary}
  Q-->>A: event "completed"
  A->>D: status = COMPLETED, summary
  A-->>B: match:updated
  B->>A: GET /results and /video (Range requests)
  B->>U: video with synchronised overlays

